        {
          "id": 21,
          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "latency_p95: burn rate (short + long windows)",
          "description": "slo_burn_rate{name=\"latency_p95\"} for every alerting window published by the refresher (PP26 pairs 5m/1h and 1h/6h). burn_rate = (1 - actual SLI) / (1 - target). Alert thresholds: > 14.4 on the 5m+1h pair, > 6.0 on the 1h+6h pair. Click a point to open the trace-viewer at that moment.",
          "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
