          "description": "slo_error_budget_remaining{name=\"latency_p95\"} - unspent share (0..1) of the rolling-window budget. Red = below the PP27 soft threshold (0.2): sampler to 5%, eval budget halved. At 0 the budget is frozen and deploys are gated (PP27 hard action).",
          "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
